  <div class="space-y-6">
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">How much does SSI Construction Manager cost?</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mt-1">$60&nbsp;CAD per month for an admin seat with unlimited projects. Additional user seats are $20&nbsp;CAD/month (free if the user already has an SSI subscription), and the optional Crew Time Clock add-on is $25&nbsp;CAD/month. <a href="/pricing/" class="text-blue-700 underline">See full pricing</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Is there a free trial?</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mt-1">Yes — every new admin account starts with a 60-day free trial, no credit card required.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Is SSI a good Procore alternative for small builders?</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mt-1">Yes. SSI is built specifically for small and mid-size builders, residential contractors, and trades who need budgets, schedules, POs, and invoice tracking without enterprise pricing. <a href="/procore-alternatives/" class="text-blue-700 underline">See the comparison</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">What budget formats does SSI support?</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mt-1">SSI supports multiple budget formats so you can match your local standard. CSI MasterFormat divisions are pre-loaded by default, and you can also use Uniformat or your own custom cost-code structure. Every cost code ties your budget, POs, and invoices together.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Can I use SSI Construction Manager outside Canada?</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mt-1">Yes. Pricing is in CAD and Stripe automatically converts to your local currency at checkout. Builders worldwide use SSI.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="text-center mt-8">
